  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Motilal Oswal Comprehensive Financing Facility Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails Asian Development Bank (ADB) providing long-term debt financing to MOHFL to support access to finance for MOHFL&amp;apos;s expansion of affordable housing loans to women homeowners and its entry into housing with green building certification. The project will also help MOHFL establish and implement its first gender-responsive Sustainable Finance Framework (SFF).</narrative>
  </description>
